    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's so heavy. like i'm carrying around this massive, useless file that shouldn't even be in the directory. i keep waiting to wake up or for the screen to flicker and show me the real world, but it's just more of the same. it feels like the only way to stop the glitching is to just... shut it all down. if an error is causing nothing but lag and weight, shouldn't it just be cleared?",
